@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Prerrequisitos
### Estos endpoints son PÚBLICOS (sin JWT). Solo rate limit 60/min.
@orderId = 1
@amount = 120000

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### ADDI WEBHOOKS
### Payload JSON. Campos obligatorios: orderId, status.
### status válidos: APPROVED | REJECTED | PENDING | INTERNAL_ERROR | ABANDONED | DECLINED
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1. Addi - webhook APROBADA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-gateway/webhook/addi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": {{orderId}},
  "applicationId": "ADDI-APP-100001",
  "status": "APPROVED",
  "approvedAmount": {{amount}}
}

### 2. Addi - webhook RECHAZADA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-gateway/webhook/addi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": {{orderId}},
  "applicationId": "ADDI-APP-100002",
  "status": "REJECTED",
  "approvedAmount": 0
}

### 3. Addi - webhook PENDIENTE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-gateway/webhook/addi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": {{orderId}},
  "applicationId": "ADDI-APP-100003",
  "status": "PENDING",
  "approvedAmount": 0
}

### 4. Addi - webhook ABANDONADA (ABANDONED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-gateway/webhook/addi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": {{orderId}},
  "applicationId": "ADDI-APP-100004",
  "status": "ABANDONED",
  "approvedAmount": 0
}

### 5. Addi - webhook con orderId inválido → ok: false
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-gateway/webhook/addi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicationId": "ADDI-APP-XXXXX",
  "status": "APPROVED",
  "approvedAmount": {{amount}}
}

### 6. Addi - webhook sin status → ok: false
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-gateway/webhook/addi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": {{orderId}},
  "applicationId": "ADDI-APP-XXXXX",
  "approvedAmount": {{amount}}
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### SISTECRÉDITO WEBHOOKS
### Payload JSON. Campos obligatorios: Invoice, PaymentMethodResponse.StatusResponse.
### StatusResponse válidos: Approved | Rejected | Pending | Failed | PendingForPaymentMethod | Cancelled
### Nota: Sistecrédito puede enviar pings de prueba con PaymentMethodResponse vacío
###       → el controller responde 200 con ok: false (sin disparar handlers).
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 7. Sistecrédito - webhook APROBADA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-gateway/webhook/sistecredito
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Invoice": "{{orderId}}",
  "Value": {{amount}},
  "Currency": "COP",
  "PaymentMethodResponse": {
    "TransactionId": "SC-123456",
    "StatusResponse": "Approved"
  }
}

### 8. Sistecrédito - webhook RECHAZADA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-gateway/webhook/sistecredito
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Invoice": "{{orderId}}",
  "Value": {{amount}},
  "Currency": "COP",
  "PaymentMethodResponse": {
    "TransactionId": "SC-123457",
    "StatusResponse": "Rejected"
  }
}

### 9. Sistecrédito - webhook PENDIENTE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-gateway/webhook/sistecredito
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Invoice": "{{orderId}}",
  "Value": {{amount}},
  "Currency": "COP",
  "PaymentMethodResponse": {
    "TransactionId": "SC-123458",
    "StatusResponse": "Pending"
  }
}

### 10. Sistecrédito - ping de prueba (PaymentMethodResponse vacío) → ok: false
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-gateway/webhook/sistecredito
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Invoice": "{{orderId}}",
  "Value": {{amount}},
  "Currency": "COP",
  "PaymentMethodResponse": {}
}

### 11. Sistecrédito - webhook sin Invoice → ok: false
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-gateway/webhook/sistecredito
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Value": {{amount}},
  "Currency": "COP",
  "PaymentMethodResponse": {
    "TransactionId": "SC-XXXXX",
    "StatusResponse": "Approved"
  }
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### BOLD WEBHOOKS
### Payload JSON.
### type válidos: SALE_APPROVED | SALE_REJECTED | VOID_APPROVED | VOID_REJECTED
###
### FIRMA: header x-bold-signature = HMAC-SHA256(base64_encode(rawBody), BOLD_SECRET_KEY)
###
### ⚠ Para probar en local reemplazar x-bold-signature con el HMAC-SHA256 real
###   calculado sobre los bytes exactos en Base64 del body usando BOLD_SECRET_KEY.
###   Sin firma válida el endpoint responde: {"ok":false,"error":"invalid_signature"}
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 12. Bold - webhook SALE_APPROVED — con x-bold-signature real
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-gateway/webhook/bold
Content-Type: application/json
x-bold-signature: REEMPLAZAR_CON_HMAC_SHA256_BASE64_BODY

{
  "type": "SALE_APPROVED",
  "data": {
    "payment_id": "BOLD-PAY-100001",
    "amount": {
      "total": {{amount}},
      "currency": "COP"
    },
    "metadata": {
      "reference": "{{orderId}}"
    }
  }
}

### 13. Bold - webhook SALE_REJECTED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-gateway/webhook/bold
Content-Type: application/json
x-bold-signature: REEMPLAZAR_CON_HMAC_SHA256_BASE64_BODY

{
  "type": "SALE_REJECTED",
  "data": {
    "payment_id": "BOLD-PAY-100002",
    "amount": {
      "total": {{amount}},
      "currency": "COP"
    },
    "metadata": {
      "reference": "{{orderId}}"
    }
  }
}

### 14. Bold - webhook VOID_REJECTED (no-op, conserva estado previo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-gateway/webhook/bold
Content-Type: application/json
x-bold-signature: REEMPLAZAR_CON_HMAC_SHA256_BASE64_BODY

{
  "type": "VOID_REJECTED",
  "data": {
    "payment_id": "BOLD-PAY-100003",
    "amount": {
      "total": {{amount}},
      "currency": "COP"
    },
    "metadata": {
      "reference": "{{orderId}}"
    }
  }
}

### 15. Bold - firma inválida → ok: false, error: invalid_signature
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment-gateway/webhook/bold
Content-Type: application/json
x-bold-signature: firma_invalida_para_verificar_rechazo

{
  "type": "SALE_APPROVED",
  "data": {
    "payment_id": "BOLD-PAY-XXXXX",
    "amount": {
      "total": {{amount}},
      "currency": "COP"
    },
    "metadata": {
      "reference": "{{orderId}}"
    }
  }
}
